{"id":"5088","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5088_main_22-halo-and-cirrostratus-fibratus_clouds-photometeors.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p><span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">22°光晕</span> 呈现为22°半径的白色或大部分白色发光环，<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">光源</span> 位于其中心。这张照片中的云主要是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">毛卷层云</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Kam Hoo Man","location":"中国香港屯门","latitude":"纬度: 22° 23' 27'' N","longitude":"经度: 113° 58' 21'' E","date":"11 July 2015 0724 (当地时间)","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: S.13.1.1","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.13.1.1"},{"src":"/images/compressed/syn/5088_syn_22-halo-and-cirrostratus-fibratus_clouds-photometeors.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"></div>","copyright":"© 香港特别行政区政府","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/upper/5088_upper_22-halo-and-cirrostratus-fibratus_clouds-photometeors.png","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>在350和450hPa之间的上升气流所指示的相对潮湿的层可以表明卷层云的高度。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 香港特别行政区政府","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4136_main_cirrostratus-nebulosus-and-22-halo_clouds-photometeors.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>照片显示了从西方入侵的一层薄薄的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">卷层云</span>云巾（照片右侧）。缺乏形态或细节将其确定为雾状云种。还可以看到少量的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">高积云</span>。主要特征是完全中等强度的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">22°太阳光晕</span>，这是由太阳光线穿过许多随机排列的冰晶引起的。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Frank Le Blancq","location":"泽西圣旺","latitude":"纬度: 49° 13' 45'' N","longitude":"经度: 2° 13' 33'' W","date":"29 March 2016 1300 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 3, CH= 6","code":"图像P/S代码: P.13.1.1","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.13.1.1"},{"src":"/images/compressed/5491_main_cirrostratus-fibratus-undulatus-with-22-halo_clouds-photometeors.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>双层卷层云是通过毛状条纹排列加以确定。在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">下层</span>，毛状条纹是东北至西南方向排列；<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">上层</span>与下层呈直角；即东南到西北。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Stephen Burt","location":"英国，伯克郡RG7，雷丁附近的斯特拉特菲尔德莫蒂默","latitude":"纬度: 51° 22' 12'' N","longitude":"经度: 1° 2' 24'' W","date":"02 December 2009 1011 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北东南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 8","code":"图像P/S代码: P.3.2","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.3.2"}]}]}